:''Not to be confused with [[Ensanglion the Calamity]].''
'''Ganglion''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]] increases health and knockbacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]].

